      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "On the second ransom call, Rodion scolds Nastya's father for bringing Kostya along and instructs him to drop the money into a trash bin around the corner. Back at the restaurant, Max calls Chef Barinov in desperation to tell him the dining room is overflowing.",
